      "schema:name": "Lineage",
      "schema:actionProcess": "This map is a digital map, with PDF download. The maps are optimised for printing on an A1 or A0 sheet (for larger specials). Layers are updated as needed and the digital download updated. They are created in ESRI ArcPro as a 'map series'. 1:250,000 topographic maps are maintained on a yearly update cycle."
